    {
      "source": "Create a <code>SimpleValueStyler</code> using the <a href=\"#DEFAULT_CLASS_STYLER\"><code>DEFAULT_CLASS_STYLER</code></a>\nand <a href=\"#DEFAULT_METHOD_STYLER\"><code>DEFAULT_METHOD_STYLER</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用<a href=\"#DEFAULT_CLASS_STYLER\"><code>DEFAULT_CLASS_STYLER</code></a>和<a href=\"#DEFAULT_METHOD_STYLER\"><code>DEFAULT_METHOD_STYLER</code></a>创建一个<code>SimpleValueStyler</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Favor <a href=\"SimpleValueStyler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.style\"><code>SimpleValueStyler</code></a> over <a href=\"DefaultValueStyler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.style\"><code>DefaultValueStyler</code></a> when you\nwish to use styling similar to the JDK or when you need configurable control\nover the styling of classes and methods.",
      "translation": "请在使用与 JDK 类似的样式或需要对类和方法的样式进行可配置控制时，优先使用 `<a href=\"SimpleValueStyler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.style\"><code>SimpleValueStyler</code></a>` 而非 `<a href=\"DefaultValueStyler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.style\"><code>DefaultValueStyler</code></a>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "For example, if the supplied method is a reference to\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html#getBytes(java.nio.charset.Charset)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String.getBytes(java.nio.charset.Charset)</code></a>, this function will\nreturn <code>\"getBytes(Charset)\"</code>.",
      "translation": "例如，如果提供的参数是 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html#getBytes(java.nio.charset.Charset)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String.getBytes(java.nio.charset.Charset)</code></a>` 的引用，此函数将返回 `<code>\"getBytes(Charset)\"</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
