    {
      "source": "<code>classStyler</code> - a function that applies styling to a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>classStyler</code> - 一个用于为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>Class</code></a> 应用样式的函数",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>methodStyler</code> - a function that applies styling to a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>methodStyler</code> - 一个用于为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> 应用样式的函数",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation returns the method's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html#getName()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\">name</a> and the <a href=\"../../util/ClassUtils.html#getShortName(java.lang.Class)\">short name</a> of the\nmethod's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html#getDeclaringClass()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\">declaring class</a>, separated by\nthe <code>\"@\"</code> symbol.",
      "translation": "默认实现返回方法的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html#getName()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\">名称</a>和方法的<a href=\"../../util/ClassUtils.html#getShortName(java.lang.Class)\">短名</a>，中间用<code>\"@\"</code>符号分隔。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation delegates to <a href=\"../../util/ClassUtils.html#getShortName(java.lang.Class)\"><code>ClassUtils.getShortName(Class)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认实现委托给<a href=\"../../util/ClassUtils.html#getShortName(java.lang.Class)\"><code>ClassUtils.getShortName(Class)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation returns <code>\"[null]\"</code>.",
      "translation": "默认实现返回 `<code>\"[null]\"</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Uses the reflective visitor pattern underneath the hood to nicely\nencapsulate styling algorithms for each type of styled object.",
      "translation": "在底层使用反射访问者模式，优雅地封装了每种样式化对象的样式算法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation returns the supplied string wrapped in\nsingle quotes.",
      "translation": "默认实现返回用单引号包裹的给定字符串。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Default <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> styling function: converts the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>\nto a simple string representation of the method's signature in the form of\n<code>&lt;method name&gt;(&lt;parameter types&gt;)</code>, where <code>&lt;parameter types&gt;</code>\nis a comma-separated list of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#getSimpleName()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">simple names</a>\nof the parameter types.",
      "translation": "默认 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>` 样式函数：将提供的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>` 转换为方法签名的简单字符串表示形式，格式为`<code>&lt;method name&gt;(&lt;parameter types&gt;)</code>`，其中 `<code>&lt;parameter types&gt;</code>` 是参数类型的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#getSimpleName()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">简单名称</a>的逗号分隔列表。",
      "count": 1
    },
